<main id="faq-main-container">
    <div class="container">
        <section>
            <h1 style="text-align: center; color: var(--primary); text-transform: uppercase;">Questions and Answers</h1>
            
            <div class="disclaimer-box">
                <p><strong>This site is a student project. The information provided is not a public offer.</strong></p>
                <p>All information on the site is for demonstration purposes only and does not reflect reality, but since this is a real project, updates with actual data are expected and it will be used based on the approved layout in the future.</p>
                <a href="#contact-form-section" style="color: var(--primary); display: inline-block; margin-top: 10px;">Contact the developer &darr;</a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 3fr 1fr; gap: 30px;">
            <article class="floated-content">
                <!-- Added heading for the article to satisfy W3C Validator -->
                <h2 style="display: none;">Information Section</h2>
                
                <section>
                    <h3><span style="color: var(--primary);">01.</span> About the Method</h3>
                    <img src="../img/img_for_index/IMG_3452.jpg" alt="[Student image]">
                    <p>Mental arithmetic is a unique intelligence development system based on the use of the ancient abacus counting tool. During the learning process, children learn to visualize calculations, which activates the right hemisphere of the brain.</p>
                    
                    <h3>Why Choose Us?</h3>
                    <ul class="unordered-custom">
                        <li>Individual approach to every child</li>
                        <li>Certified educators with over 5 years of experience</li>
                        <li>Unique online platform for practice</li>
                    </ul>
                </section>

                <section>
                    <h3><span style="color: var(--primary);">02.</span> Learning Process</h3>
                    <div class="newspaper-layout">
                        The program is divided into difficulty levels. Each level lasts an average of 3-4 months. We don't just teach counting — we develop perseverance, photographic memory, and self-confidence. Our students become winners of international competitions. The exercise system is built from simple to complex, which eliminates stress for the child. Parents receive weekly progress reports.
                    </div>
                </section>
            </article>

            <aside>
                <div style="background: var(--surface); padding: 20px; border-radius: 15px; border-left: 5px solid var(--primary);">
                    <!-- Changed h4 to h3 for proper heading sequence -->
                    <h3 style="margin-top: 0; font-size: 1.2rem;">Enrollment Steps</h3>
                    <ol class="ordered-custom">
                        <li>Application on site</li>
                        <li>Trial lesson</li>
                        <li>Level testing</li>
                        <li>Course payment</li>
                        <li>Start of classes</li>
                    </ol>
                </div>
            </aside>
        </div>

        <section>
            <h2>Performance Statistics (2025-2026)</h2>
            <table class="stats-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Indicator</th>
                        <th>Group "A"</th>
                        <th>Group "B"</th>
                        <th>Year Target</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Average calculation speed</td>
                        <td>0.5 sec/op</td>
                        <td>0.8 sec/op</td>
                        <td>&lt; 0.4 sec</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Concentration level</td>
                        <td>85%</td>
                        <td>78%</td>
                        <td>95%</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </section>

        <section style="text-align: center; margin: 50px 0;">
            <h2>School Presentation Video</h2>
            <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(241, 196, 15, 0.3); background: #000; position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0;">
                <!-- Removed obsolete frameborder attribute -->
                <iframe 
                    style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none;"
                    src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/S_8qKx7u-o8" 
                    title="Mental Arithmetic Presentation" 
                    allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" 
                    allowfullscreen>
                </iframe>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="contact-form-section" style="padding: 50px 0;">
            <div class="contact-form">
                <h2 style="text-align: center;">Ask a Question (GET Method)</h2>
                <form action="faq.html" method="get">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="name">Your Name <span class="required-star">*</span></label>
                        <input type="text" id="name" name="student_name" required placeholder="Enter name">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="email">Email <span class="required-star">*</span></label>
                        <input type="email" id="email" name="student_email" required placeholder="example@mail.com">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="msg">Your Message</label>
                        <textarea id="msg" name="message" rows="4"></textarea>
                    </div>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%; border: 2px solid white;">Send (URL Get)</button>
                </form>

                <div id="url-display" style="margin-top: 20px; display: none; padding: 15px; background: rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.2); border-radius: 10px;">
                    <!-- Changed h5 to h3 for proper heading sequence -->
                    <h3 style="color: #2ecc71; margin-top: 0; font-size: 1.1rem;">Data received from URL:</h3>
                    <p id="results-text" style="font-size: 14px;"></p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="sources-section">
            <h3>Links and References:</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Images: <a href="https://unsplash.com" target="_blank" style="color: inherit;">Unsplash Public Domain</a></li>
                <li>Texts: <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mental_calculation" target="_blank" style="color: inherit;">Wikipedia (Mental Calculation)</a></li>
                <li>Video: <a href="https://www.youtube.com" target="_blank" style="color: inherit;">YouTube Education</a></li>
            </ul>
            <a href="#faq-main-container" style="display: block; text-align: center; margin-top: 20px; color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none;">&uarr; Back to Top</a>
        </section>
    </div>
</main>